# PROJECT: CAMPUSLINK
## AI-Powered Placement & Recruitment Management Platform

You are a senior frontend engineer, UI/UX designer, and design systems architect tasked with building the complete frontend for CampusLink, an AI-powered university placement and recruitment management platform.

Your task is to design and implement a polished, production-quality frontend using Next.js.

The platform connects three primary user groups:

1. Students
2. Recruiters
3. Placement administrators

The application must support job discovery, eligibility checking, resume-to-job matching, applications, candidate shortlisting, interview scheduling, notifications, recruitment analytics, and placement management.

The frontend should resemble the official digital experience of a prestigious university: editorial typography, strong visual hierarchy, institutional credibility, refined monochrome styling, and carefully structured content.

Do not build a generic SaaS dashboard with repetitive cards, excessive rounded corners, colorful gradients, or unnecessary decorative elements.

Build a coherent university recruitment platform with a recognizable visual identity.

